cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pacer-cli in academic or legal research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: pacer-cli
abstract: >
  A command-line interface for the U.S. federal court PACER system.
  Supports case search via the PCL REST API, docket and document
  downloads from CM/ECF, local archive management, and structured
  docket parsing for legal research workflows.
authors:
